Source commit: 315e063da1f89c89e2097c6e72428ebefb9ab1d1
Derived resource: pares_genero.tsv (filtered, unambiguous same-lemma
masculine/feminine singular noun forms, with a heuristic suffix filter).
The transformation removes most of the source data and is not a guarantee
that a gender change preserves meaning in the sentence.

